{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_32442","headline":"和周繇 · 温庭筠","name":"和周繇","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"齐马驰千驷，卢姬逞十三。\n玳筵方喜睐，金勒自䟃𧽼\n堕珥情初洽，鸣鞭战未酣。\n神交花冉冉，眉语柳毶毶。\n却略青鸾镜，翘翻翠凤篸。\n专城有佳对，宁肯顾春蚕。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"温庭筠","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_32442.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_32442","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}